Crispy Salt-Crusted Carnivore Pork Belly

**Summary:** 
Melt-in-your-mouth tender pork with a shatteringly crisp skin. Pure animal-based perfection using only meat, salt, and water.

---

* **Difficulty:** Medium
* **Prep Time:** 15 minutes (plus 12-24 hours drying time)
* **Cook Time:** 90 minutes
* **Servings:** 4

### Nutrition Info (Per Serving)

